==English==

===Alternative forms===
* [[envigorate]]
* [[envigourate]] {{qualifier|rare}}
* [[invigourate]]

===Verb===
{{en-verb|invigorat|ing}}

# {{context|transitive}} To impart [[vigor]], [[strength]], or [[vitality]] to.
#: ''Exercise is '''invigorating'''.''
# {{context|transitive}} To [[heighten]] or [[intensify]].
# {{context|transitive}} To give life or energy to.
#: ''The cold water '''invigorated''' him.''
# {{context|transitive}} To make [[lively]].

====Related terms====
*[[invigorating]]
*[[invigoratingly]]
*[[invigoration]]
*[[invigorator]]

